<diagram name="2. RGH v4 (Residual Gated Hybrid)" id="p_rgh"><mxGraphModel dx="1422" dy="762" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="827" math="0" shadow="0" background="#ffffff"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="201" value="RGH v4 — CF-Anchored Residual Gated Hybrid (kiến trúc nghiên cứu)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="10" width="670" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="202" value="Đầu vào (mỗi cặp user–item trong 100 ứng viên)
• Điểm nhánh: s_ALS, s_BPR, s_GCN, s_SBERT
• Chuẩn hoá per-user: z_cf, z_bpr, z_gcn, z_txt
• Đặc trưng 6-d cho Δ/gate:
  [z_als, z_bpr, z_gcn, z_txt,  z_als−z_gcn,  z_als·z_txt]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="55" width="330" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="203" value="Neo tuyến tính (linear anchor)
score_lin = a_cf·z_cf + a_gcn·z_gcn + a_txt·z_txt
Khởi tạo: 0,60 / 0,30 / 0,10
Học được: 0,735 / 0,499 / 0,299 (20 epoch)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="55" width="330" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="204" value="Residual phi tuyến Δ (DCN cross + deep MLP)
x0 = feats (6-d)
x1 = x0 ⊙ tanh(W1·x0) + x0
x2 = x0 ⊙ tanh(W2·x1) + x1
Δ = MLP(x2): 6 → 64 → ReLU → 32 → ReLU → 1 (dropout 0,1)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="170" width="330" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="205" value="Cổng per-(user,item)
g = σ(MLP_g(feats)),  MLP_g: 6 → 32 → ReLU → 1
bias khởi tạo = −2,5  ⇒  g ≈ 0,08 lúc đầu
(gate chỉ “mở” khi residual thực sự giảm loss)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="305" width="330" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="206" value="Điểm xếp hạng cuối

score(u,i) = score_lin + g(u,i) · Δ(u,i)

→ argsort giảm dần trên 100 ứng viên

HR@10 = 0,7983 (holdout N=7.500)
NDCG@10 = 0,6374, MRR = 0,5945" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="160" width="300" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="207" value="Lý do thiết kế
• Neo CF: không phá thứ tự CF (tránh LightGated/Deep EF cũ thua ALS)
• Per-user z-score: bỏ lệch thang điểm giữa nhánh
• Gate âm + residual (He et al. 2016): khởi đầu ≈ ALS, an toàn
• Gate per-pair: xử lý warm/cold khác nhau
• So công bằng: vs LightGCN (cùng phủ 100% user)
  +5,68 điểm; không claim vượt GBDT (LambdaRank 0,8028)
• Bug v2 (lệch index CF↔SBERT) → 0,7427; sửa map → 0,7983" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="210" width="330" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="208" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="202" target="203"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="209" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="202" target="204"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="210" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="202" target="205"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="211" value="giải thích" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;dashed=1;endArrow=open;" edge="1" parent="1" source="202" target="207"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="212" value="a_cf·z_cf+a_gcn·z_gcn+a_txt·z_txt" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="203" target="206"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="213" value="Δ" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="204" target="206"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="214" value="g" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="205" target="206"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
<diagram name="3. Early Fusion V3 (Triển khai)" id="p_ef"><mxGraphModel dx="1422" dy="762" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="827" math="0" shadow="0" background="#ffffff"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="301" value="Early Fusion V3 — Mô hình triển khai chính (DCN + MLP + Listwise)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="10" width="690" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="302" value="Đầu vào ghép sớm — 1.669 chiều / (u,i)
• u_als ‖ i_als  (32 + 32), L2-norm
• u_bpr ‖ i_bpr  (32 + 32), L2-norm
• u_txt ‖ i_txt  (768 + 768), L2-norm
  (u_txt = mean embedding train history, leak-free)
• z_cf, z_bpr, z_txt  (3) — z-score per-user
• log1p(pop)/max, log1p(hist)/max  (2)

Tổng = 2·(32+32+768) + 5 = 1.669
→ Giữ embedding thô để cross network học tương tác
   CF×content (không chỉ 3 điểm như Late Fusion)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="55" width="360" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="303" value="Nhánh 1 — Cross network (3 lớp, residual)
x0 = input (1.669)
x_{l+1} = x0 ⊙ tanh(W_l · x_l) + x_l,  l=0,1,2
W_l: 1.669×1.669, không bias, init N(0; 0,02)
→ Tương tác bậc cao có kiểm soát giữa CF &amp; content" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="55" width="330" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="304" value="Nhánh 2 — Deep MLP
1.669 → 512  (ReLU, dropout 0,2)
      → 256  (ReLU, dropout 0,1)
      → 128  (ReLU)
      →   1

AdamW lr=1e-3, weight decay=1e-4
grad-clip 1,0 · tối đa 10 epoch" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="215" width="330" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="305" value="Residual readout

score(x) = deep(x) + mean(x_cross)

(1 điểm / ứng viên, xếp hạng 100 ứng viên)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="120" width="300" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="306" value="Hàm mất mát &amp; chọn mô hình
Listwise sampled softmax (T = 0,2)
L = −log[ exp(s_pos/T) / Σ_i exp(s_i/T) ]
Nhóm: 1 positive + 40 negative (train)
Đánh giá: 1 positive + 99 negative
Checkpoint theo NDCG@10 validation
